
=== PAP-815 pre-flight: radial-gradient outer-band + cepstrum/ACF ===
Per QA PAP-818: anchor radial sweep at bcCx/bcCy, find R_outer = argmax of azimuthally-averaged |dI/dr|,
then angular FFT + cepstrum + ACF at R_outer. Print also algo-anchor sweep for center self-validation.
Tooth-count interpretation: cepstrum/ACF τ → tc ≈ N_ANGLES/τ = 1024/τ

